    title The Fracture Saga - Regional Hero Arcs


    section Desert Arc - Sable vs Zaruun
        TASK - Desert Primary Initialize - Event:
            ► ACQUIRED:
            Complete intro story:
            ► COMPLETED:
            EVENT - create_npc - sable - region_bar:
            Sable - How's it going? I'm Sable, the friendliest sand witch around. I'm out here selling miracles to need. Maybe one day you'll need one of my miracles too. Maybe I'll need one from you.:
            EVENT - award_task - meet_sable

        TASK - Meet Sable - NPC:
            ► ACQUIRED:
            Sable already exists at location:
            ► COMPLETED:
            Sable - Zaruun is out there, cracking open the desert. I need the Dune Sundial to hone in on him. He's been causing sinkholes all over the desert. Please find the Sundial.:
            EVENT - award_task - deliver_dune_sundial_to_sable

        TASK - Deliver Dune Sundial to Sable - NPC:
            ► ACQUIRED:
            Deliver item dune_sundial to Sable:
            ► COMPLETED:
            Sable - Well now… you look like someone who can handle a little sandstorm of trouble. Zaruun's been cracking the desert open again — sinkholes, screaming dunes, the whole mess. He thinks the desert wants to return to emptiness. I think he's an idiot with an ego. Go knock some sense into him before he hollows the whole region.:
            EVENT - remove_item - dune_sundial:
            EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - sable - Zaruun is still out there, cracking open the desert. Go stop him. I've heard he's holed up somewhere in the desert nearby. Be careful.:
            EVENT - award_task - defeat_zaruun

        TASK - Meet Zaruun - NPC:
            ► ACQUIRED:
            EVENT - create_dungeon - zaruun_lair - region_open_area:
            EVENT - create_npc - zaruun - None:
            ► COMPLETED:
            Zaruun - So the witch sends another fool. The desert is thinning — can't you feel it? I merely help it shed its last illusions. Turn back, or be swallowed with the rest.:
            EVENT - award_task - defeat_zaruun_boss_fight

        TASK - Defeat Zaruun - MOB:
            ► ACQUIRED:
            EVENT - begin_combat - boss_battle - zaruun_1:
            ► COMPLETED:
            Zaruun - You delay the desert's truth… but the void waits beneath every grain.:
            EVENT - hide_npc - zaruun:
            EVENT - complete_region_quest - desert:
            EVENT - award_task - report_to_sable

        TASK - Report to Sable - NPC:
            ► ACQUIRED:
            Returning to Sable:
            ► COMPLETED:
            Sable - Well done, traveler. Zaruun's gone, and the desert can breathe again — for now. You've got grit. I like that. I'll tag along. Someone needs to keep you alive.:
            EVENT - hide_npc - sable:
            EVENT - character_join - sable

